  "description": "Change of Use from Take Away Cafe to Launderette (Use class Sui Generis)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed change of use to a launderette (Sui Generis), by reason of noise and vibration arising from the operation of washing and drying machinery, would result in an unacceptable level of disturbance to neighbouring residential occupiers. In the absence of an adequate Noise Impact Assessment demonstrating effective mitigation, the proposal would cause undue harm to the living conditions of nearby residents and is therefore contrary to Policy GR1 of Harow Local Plan (2021-2041) and paragraphs 135 and 198 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
